TI  - Associations Between Glucagon-Like Peptide-1 Receptor Agonists (GLP-1RAs) and Cancer Risk: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis.
AU  - Lalani Isha
AU  - Nambayan Reynaldo
AU  - Carbonell Chantelle
AU  - Ruan Yibing
AU  - O'Sullivan Dylan E
AU  - Stukalin Igor
AU  - Hilsden Robert J
