TI  - Diabetes-type-specific thyroid safety of GLP-1 receptor agonists: evidence from a large real-world cohort.
AU  - Hsieh Hao-I
AU  - Huang Yu-Nan
AU  - Chang Ya-Wen
AU  - Liao Wen-Ling
JO  - Therapeutic advances in endocrinology and metabolism
